  "question": {
    "text": "Among, $\\mathrm{Sc}, \\mathrm{Mn}, \\mathrm{Co}$ and Cu , identify the element with highest enthalpy of atomisation. The spin only magnetic moment value of that element in its +2 oxidation state is _____ BM (in nearest integer).",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "4",
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{array}{|l|l|l|l|l|}\\hline & Sc & Mn & Co & Cu \\\\\\hline \\begin{array}{l} \\text{Enthalpy of} \\\\ \\text{Atomisation} \\\\(kJ/mole)\\end{array} & 326 & 281 & 425 & 339 \\\\\\hline\\end{array}$<br />Highest Co<br />$\\mathrm{Co}^{+2}=(\\mathrm{Ar}) 3 \\mathrm{~d}^7$<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/HoLdwICLT7h9hmziv-S-r5pYpI8h8wvICZd-jGZbtE8.original.fullsize.png\"/><br />$\\begin{aligned}<br />& \\mathrm{n}=3 \\\\<br>& \\mu=\\sqrt{15}=3.87<br />\\end{aligned}$<br />Nearest integer $=4$",
    "image": null
  },
